### Login to get token automatically
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "chaituu@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
### Create Email Task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/task
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskType": "email",
  "data": {
    "email": "test@gmail.com"
  }
}



### Create Image Task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/task
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskType": "image",
  "data": {
    "imageName": "photo.png"
  }
}



### Create Report Task
POST http://localhost:5000/api/task
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskType": "report",
  "data": {
    "reportName": "sales-report"
  }
}



### Get All Tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Authorization: {{token}}



### Get Task By ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/task/PASTE_TASK_ID_HERE
Authorization: {{token}}